{
  "title": { "zh": "从哪开始", "en": "Where it starts" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "发送方随时可能开口，而空着的线读出来是 0：一个以 0 开头的字节和安静的线分不出来，收的一方不知道从哪一拍数起。于是两头约好：字节之前先说一个 1，叫<wiki-ref to=\"start-bit\"></wiki-ref>；字节之后说一个 0，叫<wiki-ref to=\"stop-bit\"></wiki-ref>。",
        "en": "The sender may begin at any tick, and an idle wire reads 0: a byte that begins with 0s looks just like a quiet wire, and the receiver cannot tell where to start counting. So the ends agree that a 1, the <wiki-ref to=\"start-bit\"></wiki-ref>, comes before each byte, and a 0, the <wiki-ref to=\"stop-bit\"></wiki-ref>, after it."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "brief": {
        "zh": "对方随时可能先说一个 1，再送 8 位，最后说一个 0；每收到一个字节，就在它最后一位到达的那一拍输出它，其余各拍输出「—」。",
        "en": "At any tick the far end may say a 1, then 8 bits, then a 0; output each byte on the tick its last bit arrives, and 「—」 on every other tick."
      },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "线空着的时候，来的第一个 1 就是起始位。", "en": "While the wire is idle, the first 1 to come is a start bit." },
        {
          "zh": "正在收一个字节时，线上的 1 是数据，不是起始位。",
          "en": "While a byte is coming in, a 1 on the wire is data, not a start bit."
        },
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"deserializer\"></part-ref>从「开始」那一拍收进第一位。",
          "en": "<part-ref to=\"deserializer\"></part-ref> takes in its first bit on the start tick."
        }
      ],
      "wires": { "in": [{ "name": "line", "label": { "zh": "进线", "en": "Wire in" } }] },
      "outputs": [{ "name": "byte", "label": { "zh": "字节", "en": "Byte" } }],
      "tests": [
        { "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [65], "format": "startstop" }] } } },
        { "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "idle": 4 }, { "bytes": [0], "format": "startstop" }] } } },
        { "wires": { "line": { "send": [{ "bytes": [200, 7], "format": "startstop" }] } } }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "wires": {
            "line": {
              "send": [
                { "idle": 3 },
                { "bytes": [255], "format": "startstop" },
                { "idle": 5 },
                { "bytes": [129, 254], "format": "startstop" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "wires": {
            "line": {
              "send": [
                { "bytes": [128], "format": "startstop" },
                { "idle": 1 },
                { "bytes": [1], "format": "startstop" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "want": { "byte": { "decoded": { "wire": "line", "format": "startstop" } } },
      "solution": [
        "z = const[value=0]()",
        "o = const[value=1]()",
        "eight = const[value=8]()",
        "b = reg[reg=A, start=0]()",
        "sn = select(b, z, line)",
        "c = counter(sn)",
        "e8 = equal(c, eight)",
        "e1 = equal(c, o)",
        "d = deserializer(line, e1)",
        "cl = select(e8, z, b)",
        "nb = select(sn, o, cl)",
        "kb = keep[reg=A](nb)",
        "y = select(e8, d.byte)",
        "out = select(b, y)",
        "byte <- out"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "z = const[value=0]()",
        "o = const[value=1]()",
        "eight = const[value=8]()",
        "c = counter(line)",
        "e8 = equal(c, eight)",
        "e1 = equal(c, o)",
        "d = deserializer(line, e1)",
        "y = select(e8, d.byte)",
        "byte <- y"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
